      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARAMOUNT WAR (4) looks ready to break through after being beaten half a length by Who I Think I Am at this track, where he travelled well and was only caught late. He is third-up, has placed at this venue and looks set to peak in a winnable race. NED KELLY (3) was below market expectations when sixth as a well-supported favourite at Bairnsdale, but he worked home from a rearward position and is better suited to this trip second up given his form last campaign. ALLTOGETHERNOW (1) was plain at Ballarat, beaten over 12 lengths after being slow away, yet his previous third at this venue behind King Snitz reads very well. Have to give another chance. ROLLIN'ONTHERIVER (9) remains unplaced after three starts but has less convictions than most and can improve into the minor money. RANG A ROUND UP (5) has had a few chances and is a rough place chance.",
